  concept: 'Authored objective: Recover three link faults.

    Authored requirement:
    Identify the lane 2 coupling, reference clock and lane 3 contact faults, then
    verify new link and traffic evidence after each repair.

    General teaching
    principle: Communication links require compatible endpoints, timing, signal integrity
    and the authored link tests.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can
    establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: Two speakers must agree on a language and timing, not merely share a cable.
  diagram: '[Authored setup] -> [Check prerequisites] -> [Observe the game evidence]
    -> [Verify objective]'
  misconception: Physical connectivity alone does not establish successful protocol
    communication.
